  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Inversin Social Local Proinsol</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Investment Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROINSOL IS A PROGRAM ORIENTED TO INCREASE SOCIAL AND URBAN BASIC INFRASTRUCTURE SERVICES TO LOW INCOME POPULATIONS, STRENGTHENING THE VARIOUS LEVELS OF LOCAL STATE AND MUNICIPAL GOVERNMENTS IN ORDER TO IMPROVE THEIR CAPACITY FOR DELIVERING SERVICES. THE PROGRAM HAS THREEE COMPONENTS: INVESTMENT PROJECTS, PREINVESTMENT AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
